	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "KOGUMA MK4 encoder board v2 (6.0x10.3x0.6, motor mount v12): pads at the edge that butts against the underside of the main board. The 7 pads are on both faces: back (B, inner) 0.2-1.2mm and chip side (F, outer) 0.2-0.8999999999999999mm from the edge, pitch 0.8mm. Mount v12 has a relief above the chip-side pads for the solder fillet. Magnet axis at 6.1mm")
